    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Bandol, famous for its wines and lively harbour, has several seafront hotels that accept dogs — a good base with its Dog Beach just below the Deferrari stadium.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Conditions still need confirming case by case depending on the establishment, especially in high season when hotels may limit the number of rooms that accept pets.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: wine estates around Bandol sometimes offer dog-friendly tours — ask them directly before stopping by.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Saint-Cyr-sur-Mer beach, also open to dogs, is a few minutes' drive away.</p>
